      "showLabel": true,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 300,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Script Node Class\n\nA script is a visible behavior object, not an opaque source-code box.\n\n- Summary and icon views establish identity and purpose.\n- Detail exposes source location, effects, mutation policy, grants, multiplicity, and companion-node requirements.\n- The primary editor configures behavior; raw source remains an advanced surface.\n- Native Script execution, Run, dry-run, result, and resize behavior remain host-owned.\n- Presentation does not imply safe standalone placement: undeclared coupling is a contract failure.",
        "title": "Script Contract",
        "visibilityRole": "browser"
      },
